# Ad-hoc verification runs. `undefined/` is the classic: a hand-run with an
# unset env var builds a profile under the literal string, and a broad
# `git add -A` then commits a COPY OF THE REAL PROFILE — ISO path, replay dir,
# memcard paths and Dolphin's analytics ID. That happened once (fa7874c).
